Response: documented from human-service POST /orgs/audiences/split, which owns it; the gateway forwards it unchanged. Its full document: GET /v1/platform/services/human.","params":[],"body":{"type":"object","properties":{"brandId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"targetAudience":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"The confirmed free-text answer to 'who do you sell to?' (e.g. 'B2B SaaS founders in the US and Europe')."}},"required":["brandId","targetAudience"]},"answers":[{"status":"200","description":"Proposed segments (human-service shape)","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"axes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["geography","company_size","industry","seniority_role"]},"description":"The axes the segments partition the target along: empty when a single segment is returned, one axis, or two axes crossed. Only axes a people search can filter on."},"segments":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Short label, max 4 words, unique within the proposal."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"One plain-language sentence that fully specifies the segment on its own (who, where, what kind of company, plus this segment's partition value). Becomes the audience's description on confirm."},"icon":{"type":"string","enum":["globe-hemisphere-west","globe-hemisphere-east","map-pin","user","users-three","buildings","building-office","crown","briefcase","user-circle","rocket-launch","code","cpu","storefront","shopping-cart","factory","stethoscope","first-aid-kit","bank","scales","graduation-cap","megaphone","handshake","house-line","truck","fork-knife","airplane-tilt","leaf","paint-brush","heartbeat","target"],"description":"Phosphor icon name (kebab-case) from a closed vocabulary; `globe-hemisphere-west` renders as <GlobeHemisphereWest /> in @phosphor-icons/react."},"iconConfidence":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1,"description":"The judge's own certainty about the icon (decorative: the icon is always set)."}},"required":["name","description","icon","iconConfidence"]},"minItems":1,"maxItems":6,"description":"1 to 6 mutually exclusive segments that together cover the target. Nothing is persisted."}},"required":["axes","segments"]}}],"needsTheirYes":false}
